tooltip_text = "Choose a save storage mode
JSON - a full json save file for each quicksave
               + human readable
               - large. 
              good for debugging, not long playthroughs

GIT - A git repo for a playthrough, saves are commits
           -Requires git to be installed on path. 
           + each save in that playthrough is a lightweight commit - 
           + any regular diff tool can be used to view and backup your data. 
           A silly idea, but works well. Cannot yet create branches, but will"

